    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      64.49,
      634.51,
      538.81,
      674.77
    ],
    "text": "On perusal of the judgment of the learned trial Judge it is very clear that the learned trial Judge had considered all the material evidence that had",
    "fonts": [
