    "bbox": [
      65.24,
      676.51,
      538.07,
      717.02
    ],
    "text": "been led before him at the trial by both parties. A Court of Appeal will not lightly disturb the finding of a trial Judge with regard to the",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
