      59.62,
      144.81,
      533.99,
      185.68
    ],
    "text": "lilt is rare that a decision of a judge so express, so explicit upon a point of fact purely is over ruled by a Court of Appeal, because the Courts of",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica",
      "Helvetica-Oblique"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.018208503723145,
      13.38511848449707,
